from pathlib import Path
root=Path('/workspace/zyx/docs/apps/docs/content/docs')
for lang in ['zh','en']:
 p=root/lang/'zyx/architecture/native-single-file-storage-plan.mdx'
 text='''\n单组冷模式的实际 Native 发布见 `20261023-core-cost-cold-native-lifecycle/`，本段取代前述“只有零写入准备”的阶段限制。正常协调器现在从精确持久化描述符／源 pin 读取 Mode3，原同一批次实际安装 field pages、cold binding／GroupDirectory、Immutable／manifest／content-index、Entity Map／计数／派生树和最终描述符。原有 data-before-root、A/B、原源 fence、额度、逻辑 ID lease 与封闭 NativeHybridTopologyPublication 凭证不变。私有 candidate ReadContext 入口仍无条件在首次物理写入前拒绝；前向公开冷转换／采用仍由原 guard 关闭，不新增放行开关。只在已适配的 metadata／封闭图协调器中使用冷模式 source view，通用 groupRecord／未适配 ColumnVisitor guard 保留。PropertyCollectionRootStore 的只读 group／live 探针改用同一实际 Entity Map／竞争 ROW 认证的 ownerLiveness，区分无组、未存活 pending slot 和存活无属性 owner，不解压冷体，不授予写权限。\n\n17 项定向测试实际提交冷热 SET／整列降级、带大冷值的新 Node、无属性 Edge（含邻接／type count）、删除、63-old-owner＋1-new-owner 混合提交、属性清空保留存活 owner、最后组清理及完整大 ROW 逆转换；验证未直接修改的列成员、NULL、旧 pin、普通读取与完整 integrity。真实字段索引／唯一支持树随冷值一起更新，重复键／非空违规保留原根和 I/O epoch。部分 inactive A/B 故障重开只见旧值，完整 inactive A/B 故障重开见完整新值与 manifest；实际私有写之后取消保留旧根、退款并可重试。实验两种 membership 各 554 项相关模块、默认 154 项通过，无失败／跳过。\n\n这些实际生命周期测试使用完整、一致的持久化冷源夹具：实际 Entity／邻接／Catalog／索引／字段页／目录已存在；在测试观察 pin 之前用既有测试字节 seam 将候选目录装入既有描述符帧，并先通过普通读取及完整 integrity。该夹具初始化不是公开 ROW→冷转换，也不证明前向 data-before-root、空间准入或采用。生命周期夹具使用符合既有 Catalog／Retire Queue 合同的初始 epoch1；读专用 epoch99 夹具仍保留以区分物理／语义代次，不用其证明实际退役。保留原失败报告：调用者读取必须带原资源账户；不带 sealed 创建凭证的底层事务不能替代后端同一逻辑执行器；LargeValue-aware 源 store 和只读池附件遵循后端原合同。没有为通过测试关闭这些检查或放宽退役校验。\n\n仍未验收：跨组／混合 namespace 协调、共享字段帧的实际逆转换保留分支、完整回收与搬迁、前向公开冷转换及其实际生命周期、完整空间／私有 staged-target 准入、4096 字节完整查询与剩余主成本，以及最终 P7。进度仍 90%，无全量单测／性能矩阵／提交／推送；本轮测试与归档不能代替 Kuzu 目标。\n''' if lang=='zh' else '''\nActual single-group cold Native publication is recorded in `20261023-core-cost-cold-native-lifecycle/`; this supersedes the earlier preparation-only limitation. Normal coordination reads Mode3 from the exact durable descriptor/source pin and actually installs field pages, cold bindings/GroupDirectory, Immutable/manifests/content index, Entity Map/counts/derived trees and final descriptor in the original single batch. Preserve data-before-root, A/B, original fences, budgets, logical-ID leases and sealed NativeHybridTopologyPublication authority. Private candidate-context entries still unconditionally refuse before first physical I/O. Public forward cold conversion/adoption remains guarded, with no bypass switch. Only adapted metadata/sealed graph coordination uses cold source views; generic groupRecord/unadapted ColumnVisitor guards stay. PropertyCollectionRootStore read-only group/live probes use ownerLiveness with the same actual Entity Map/competing ROW authentication, distinguishing absent groups, pending dead slots and live propertyless owners without cold decoding or write authority.\n\n17 targeted cases actually commit hot/cold SET/demotion, new Nodes with large cold values, propertyless Edges including adjacency/type counts, deletion, mixed63old+1new ownership, property clearing with live owners retained, final-group cleanup and complete large-ROW inverse. Verify untouched demoted members, NULL, old pins, ordinary readers and full integrity. Actual scalar indexes/uniqueness support move with cold values; duplicate/required-field refusal preserves roots and I/O epoch. Partial inactive A/B fault reopens the old value; complete inactive A/B fault reopens the complete new value/manifest. Cancellation after actual private writes preserves the old root, refunds and retries. Both experimental membership variants pass554 related module checks, default154, with no failures/skips.\n\nThese lifecycle tests use coherent durable cold fixtures with actual Entity/adjacency/Catalog/index/field/directory state. Before any test-observed pin, the existing test byte seam installs candidate routing into its already-allocated descriptor frame; ordinary readers/full integrity validate the source. This fixture initialization is NOT public ROW-to-cold conversion or proof of forward data-before-root, space admission or adoption. Durable fixtures use initial epoch1 under existing Catalog/Retire Queue contracts; read-only epoch99 fixtures still distinguish physical/semantic generations and do not prove retirement. Preserve setup failures: callers must supply their original read account; lower transactions lacking sealed creation authority do not replace the backend's logical executor; LargeValue-aware read-only attachments follow existing backend contracts. No guard or retirement validation was weakened to pass.\n\nUnaccepted: cross-group/mixed-namespace coordination, actual retained shared-field-frame inverse branch, full reclamation/relocation, public forward cold conversion and its lifecycle, whole-space/private staged-target admission,4096-byte full queries/remaining primary costs and final P7. Progress90%, no full suite/timing matrix/commit/push. Tests and archiving do not satisfy the Kuzu objective.\n'''
 s=p.read_text();assert '20261023-core-cost-cold-native-lifecycle/' not in s;p.write_text(s+text)
 p=root/lang/'zyx/architecture/optimization.mdx';s=p.read_text();a=s.index('1. **唯一优先候选：' if lang=='zh' else '1. **One priority candidate:');b=s.index('\n2. **',a)
 text='''1. **唯一优先候选：热字段列＋既有 ROW remainder，完成真实公开转换。** 实验 13／39 的单组冷热修改／整列降级、实体创建／删除／属性清空／最后组清理／逆转换，已在一致持久化冷源夹具中完成同一 Native 批次的实际安装，并验证旧 pin、完整 integrity、索引／唯一／非空约束、A/B 重开、取消／退款／重试；证据统一见[存储规范](native-single-file-storage-plan)，不是公开 ROW→冷转换验收。剩余只围绕该协调器补齐跨组／混合 namespace、共享字段帧实际保留分支及完整回收／搬迁，再接通通过完整空间准入的前向公开冷转换。前向转换／采用入口保持关闭，不用测试夹具初始化替代门禁；随后只用实际公开转换数据验收完整生命周期和真实查询。保留 data-before-root、原源 fence、实际 Entity／竞争 ROW、原块代次／manifest、全部字段类型和账户退款；只重打包受影响冷块，整列降级按原热集合认证本组所有冷根目录并迁移全部幸存成员。新 owner 仍需原逻辑 ID lease 与 sealed 实体创建凭证。不得增建 OwnerMap／ExtensionDirectory、标签索引、缓存或 backend，不扩展 WAL／向量，不提高 64-owner／4096-membership 转换／8 组／1 MiB 边界。''' if lang=='zh' else '''1. **One priority candidate: hot columns plus existing ROW remainder; finish actual public conversion.** Experimental13/39 single-group hot/cold changes/demotion, Entity birth/deletion/property clearing/final-group cleanup/inverse now actually install through one Native batch on coherent durable cold fixtures, with old pins, full integrity, indexes/unique/required constraints, A/B reopen, cancellation/refunds/retry. Evidence is centralized in the [storage specification](native-single-file-storage-plan), not public ROW-to-cold conversion acceptance. Remaining work stays within this coordinator: cross-group/mixed namespaces, actual shared-field-frame retention and complete reclamation/relocation, then forward public cold conversion passing complete space admission. Keep forward conversion/adoption closed; fixture initialization cannot replace admission. Accept full lifecycle/real queries on actually publicly converted data afterward. Preserve data-before-root, original fences, actual Entity/competing ROW, original block generations/manifests, all types and refunds. Repack affected cold blocks only; whole-column demotion authenticates all original cold directories against original hot tokens and migrates every survivor. New owners still need original logical-ID leases/sealed Entity creation proof. Add no OwnerMap/ExtensionDirectory, label index, cache or backend; expand neither WAL/vector scope nor64owner/4096conversion-membership/8group/1MiB bounds.'''
 s=s[:a]+text+s[b:];p.write_text(s)
 p=root/lang/'zyx/architecture/native-capability-acceptance-matrix.mdx';s=p.read_text();s+= ('\n单组 Mode3 实际 Native 发布：`20261023-core-cost-cold-native-lifecycle/` 记录持久化夹具上的冷热修改／降级、创建／删除／清空／最后组／逆转换，以及旧 pin、完整 integrity、实际索引／约束、A/B 重开和取消／退款／重试。通用未适配 guard 与前向公开转换 guard 保留；夹具初始化不算公开转换或空间采用。跨组／共享帧／完整回收搬迁、全库准入与 P7 仍待验收，进度 90%。\n' if lang=='zh' else '\nActual single-group Mode3 Native publication: `20261023-core-cost-cold-native-lifecycle/` records durable-fixture hot/cold mutation/demotion, birth/deletion/clearing/final groups/inverse, old pins, full integrity, actual indexes/constraints, A/B reopen and cancellation/refunds/retry. Generic unadapted/forward-conversion guards remain; fixture initialization is not public conversion or space adoption. Cross-group/shared-frame/full reclamation/relocation, whole-space admission and P7 remain open, progress90%.\n');p.write_text(s)
